      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-06",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 30000,
            "end": 90000,
            "text": "Good morning, appreciate you setting this up."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 102000,
            "end": 162000,
            "text": "Let's get into it, what would you like to start with?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-06",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 168000,
            "end": 186000,
            "text": "It has been a fairly normal month for us, a couple of things came up though."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 204000,
            "end": 258000,
            "text": "Sounds good, I am ready to take notes as we go."
          },
          {
            "start": 258001,
            "end": 306000,
            "text": "Glad to hear things are generally steady, let's dig into the specifics."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-06",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 312000,
            "end": 324000,
            "text": "Our renewal reminder emails are getting flagged as spam by some of the bigger providers, so members are missing the notice entirely."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-06",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 342000,
            "end": 402000,
            "text": "Out of our last renewal batch on September 8th, roughly 90 of our 500 families told us the notice never arrived."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 420000,
            "end": 456000,
            "text": "Thanks for the specifics, I have a quick question before we move on."
          },
          {
            "start": 456001,
            "end": 462000,
            "text": "Do you know which email providers those members are on, big consumer ones or something else?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-06",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 480000,
            "end": 516000,
            "text": "It was mostly one of the big consumer providers, a few smaller ones as well."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 528000,
            "end": 570000,
            "text": "Before we close out, anything else worth flagging while we have time?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-06",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 576000,
            "end": 606000,
            "text": "Our executive director is speaking on a panel at next month's conference."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 624000,
            "end": 630000,
            "text": "That sounds like a good opportunity, hope the panel goes well."
